<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="490182904"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1509700006"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Hold Me"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="R3HAB"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Hold Me"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="02:40.759"><div begin="00:07.000" end="02:19.000"><p begin="00:07.000" end="00:08.338" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">I don't know who you are<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我并不知道你是谁</span></p><p begin="00:09.000" end="00:13.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">You say I know you like I know myself<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可你却说你比我自己还要了解我</span></p><p begin="00:13.000" end="00:15.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">You talk reception<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这只是你的感觉</span></p><p begin="00:15.000" end="00:20.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">Maybe I could love you like nobody else<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也许我会比任何人都爱你</span></p><p begin="00:20.000" end="00:21.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">Let's see how far<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那就让我们拭目以待吧</span></p><p begin="00:23.000" end="00:27.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">We can take this without breaking hearts<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们可以尽情相爱 我们不会伤害彼此</span></p><p begin="00:26.437" end="00:28.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">You know I'm ready though<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的心足够坚定</span></p><p begin="00:29.000" end="00:32.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">So what are we afraid of?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那么我们在害怕什么呢</span></p><p begin="00:33.000" end="00:36.015" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">We pretend we're not falling<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">假装我们并未深陷爱情的沼泽</span></p><p begin="00:36.015" end="00:40.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">You can't keep your hands off of me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可你早已无法放手</span></p><p begin="00:40.000" end="00:43.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">You caught me without warning<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">毫无预兆 你就俘获了我的心</span></p><p begin="00:43.000" end="00:46.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">You hold me, you hold me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你拥我入怀 拥我入怀</span></p><p begin="00:46.000" end="00:49.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">Close enough to see right through me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们离得这么近 你像是要看穿我的心</span></p><p begin="00:49.000" end="00:53.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">I can't take my eyes off of you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的视线无法从你身上移开</span></p><p begin="00:53.000" end="00:56.315" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">You caught me without warning<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">毫无预兆 你就俘获了我的心</span></p><p begin="00:56.315" end="00:59.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">You hold me, you hold me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你拥我入怀 拥我入怀</span></p><p begin="01:11.000" end="01:13.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">You hold me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你拥我入怀</span></p><p begin="01:13.000" end="01:14.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">Wanna be where you are<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想追随你到天涯海角</span></p><p begin="01:15.000" end="01:18.666" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">Im drowning in my thoughts, I'm losing sleep<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我胡思乱想 难以入眠</span></p><p begin="01:18.666" end="01:21.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">It's just perception<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这就是我的感觉</span></p><p begin="01:22.000" end="01:25.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">But I wish that you were laying next to me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我多么希望你能与我相依而眠</span></p><p begin="01:25.000" end="01:28.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">Can't wait for your call<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">等待着你的来电</span></p><p begin="01:29.000" end="01:32.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">Wanna run but first we learn to crawl<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要和你一起 摸索着前行</span></p><p begin="01:32.000" end="01:35.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">See what we're made of<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的心足够坚定</span></p><p begin="01:35.000" end="01:38.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">So what are we afraid of?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那么我们在害怕什么呢</span></p><p begin="01:39.000" end="01:42.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">We pretend we're not falling<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">假装我们并未深陷爱情的沼泽</span></p><p begin="01:42.000" end="01:46.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">You can't keep your hands off of me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可你早已无法放手</span></p><p begin="01:46.000" end="01:49.313" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">You caught me without warning<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">毫无预兆 你就俘获了我的心</span></p><p begin="01:49.313" end="01:52.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">You hold me, you hold me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你拥我入怀 拥我入怀</span></p><p begin="01:52.000" end="01:56.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">Close enough to see right through me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们离得这么近 你像是要看穿我的心</span></p><p begin="01:56.000" end="01:59.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">I can't take my eyes off of you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的视线无法从你身上移开</span></p><p begin="01:59.000" end="02:02.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">You caught me without warning<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">毫无预兆 你就俘获了我的心</span></p><p begin="02:02.000" end="02:04.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">You hold me, you hold me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你拥我入怀 拥我入怀</span></p><p begin="02:04.000" end="02:06.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">You hold me</p><p begin="02:17.000" end="02:19.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">You hold me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你拥我入怀</span></p></div></body></tt>